### 3.4 Version 1 Billing Rules (client-agreed, May 2026)

These rules apply to the **Version 1 launch** and take precedence over any conflicting Phase 2 billing assumptions. Source: client (Ciony Holloway), May 2026.

#### 3.4.1 Unified monthly plan — hosted page + widget

- **One monthly subscription** covers **both**:
  - the **hosted announcement page / shareable link** (`t2ms.live`), **and**
  - the **widget embed** on the same site/business.
- There is **no double charge** for using hosted page and widget together on the **same account/site**.
- Onboarding path selection (**hosted link only** vs **widget embed**) controls **setup flow only**, not which product the customer is buying. Copy and plan features must reflect a single subscription with both capabilities available on the same site.

#### 3.4.2 Install add-on — hosted-only customers upgrading to widget

- The **install add-on** remains an **optional one-time paid product** (see [Section 2.2](#22-install-add-on)), separate from the monthly subscription.
- If a customer starts on the **hosted-only** onboarding path and later wants a **widget installed on their existing website**, they may purchase the install/setup add-on **at that time** (via dashboard / install-request flow).
- The monthly plan does **not** need to change when they add a widget later; only the one-time install fee applies when they request professional installation.

#### 3.4.3 Church introductory pricing (launch period)

Church pricing applies **only** to **verified churches / religious organizations** during the **introductory launch period**.

| Term | Value |
|------|-------|
| Free trial | **14 days** |
| Monthly price | **$7.99/month** |
| Price lock | Locked for **up to 3 years** for early church adopters |
| Eligibility | Verified church / religious organization during intro launch phase |

**Implementation notes (non-functional requirements):**

- Church checkout/plan must be **gated** so only verified eligible organizations can subscribe at the intro rate (verification mechanism TBD — e.g. admin approval, attestation + review).
- Stripe must use a dedicated **$7.99/mo** price with **14-day trial**; price-lock for 3 years must be enforced via Stripe configuration and/or customer metadata (e.g. grandfathered price ID, subscription metadata, launch cutoff date).
- Plan marketing copy must **not** present hosted page and widget as separate paid monthly products for church (or general) plans.

