## 4. Customer Onboarding + SMS Consent Gate

### 4.1 Required Onboarding Fields (Install Setup)

These fields are required when we will create an **Install Job** (i.e. when the customer has purchased or will use the **install add-on**). See [Section 2 – Clarification](#2-clarification-onboarding-vs-install-add-on-vs-install-setup).

Customer must provide:
- Website URL(s)
- Platform (WordPress, Squarespace, Google Sites, Custom, etc.)
- Install type:
  - Script embed
  - iFrame embed (restricted)
- Preferred placement
- Access method (rules below)
- Notes / constraints

### 4.2 SMS Consent Confirmation (Hard Gate)

**This is NOT A2P registration.**

Customer must confirm:
> "I confirm I have permission to message my contacts using T2MS and understand SMS compliance requirements (TCPA/CTIA)."

#### Requirements:
- Checkbox + typed confirmation
- Store: `sms_consent_confirmed_at`
- Platform-level A2P approval (if required) is handled separately and does NOT block installs.

