## 10. Installation & QA Requirements

### 9.1 Installation

- Script embed for normal sites
- iFrame embed for restricted platforms (Google Sites, etc.)

### 9.2 Required QA Checklist

Worker must confirm:
- ✅ Widget loads on desktop
- ✅ Widget loads on mobile
- ✅ Messaging UI opens
- ✅ Test message sends
- ✅ Incoming message reaches correct channel
- ✅ Reply reaches test phone
- ✅ No layout or console errors

### 9.3 Required Proof Uploads

- Desktop screenshot
- Mobile / responsive screenshot
- Message send + receive proof (or log reference)

#### Upload Constraints:
- Max file size: 10MB
- Types: PNG, JPG, PDF
- Storage: secure object storage (e.g., S3)
- Retention: 90 days

**System blocks submission if proof missing.**

