## 11. Completion & QA Validation

### 10.1 Submission

- Worker submits → `SUBMITTED_FOR_QA`

### 10.2 Auto-Completion Rules (Phase 2)

Job auto-completes only if:
- Checklist complete
- Proof present
- Site URL returns HTTP 200
- Widget container detected (basic check)
- Proof timestamps recorded

### 10.3 Fixes

- QA failure → `NEEDS_FIX` (returns to same worker)

